    'Activity, tasks, and results compare the selected window with the immediately preceding equal window. For enrolled, started, and completed, the large number is the permanent all-time total while the delta compares new events in those two equal windows. Monthly Personal CC and both 4 CC indicators cover only the current FLP structure. Official 4 CC counts confirmed FLP360 signals; effective 4 CC uses the official 1/0 and only falls back, when that signal is missing, to Personal CC ≥ 1 and inclusive Total Active CC ≥ 4.' => 'Aktivnost, zadaci i rezultati porede izabrani period sa neposredno prethodnim periodom iste dužine. Za broj upisanih, započetih i završenih, veliki broj je trajni ukupan zbir, dok promena poredi nove događaje u ta dva jednaka perioda. Mesečni Personal CC i oba pokazatelja 4 CC obuhvataju samo trenutnu FLP strukturu. Zvanični 4 CC broji potvrđene FLP360 signale; efektivni 4 CC koristi zvaničnu vrednost 1/0 i, samo ako taj signal nedostaje, koristi Personal CC ≥ 1 i inkluzivni Total Active CC ≥ 4.',
