    'Understood: the focus is lips, not face or body. I currently do not have a sufficiently reviewed record for an automatic lip-care recommendation. Would you like to check the official description or current label of a product you have?' => 'Razumem: fokus su usne, a ne lice ili telo. Trenutno nemam dovoljno proverene evidencije da bih automatski preporučio negu usana. Da li želiš da proveriš zvanični opis ili trenutnu deklaraciju nekog proizvoda koji imaš?',
