    'Obrnuta IP pretraga' => 'Obrnuta IP pretraga',
    'It is usually included in a daily routine according to the instructions on the packaging.' => 'Obično se uključuje u svakodnevnu rutinu prema uputstvu na pakovanju.',
    'Share of canceled billing is stable' => 'Udeo otkazanih plaćanja je stabilan',
