    'When food feels heavy and there is a lingering sense of heaviness after meals, the recommendation should stay on an aloe base plus probiotic support, without drifting into weight-control programs.' => 'Kada hrana deluje teško i osećaj težine nakon obroka dugo traje, preporuka treba da ostane zasnovana na aloji i probiotskoj podršci, bez usmeravanja na programe za kontrolu težine.',
