    'When the problem is evening eating, the answer should stay practical and centered on appetite, without making Therm the first product right away.' => 'Kada je problem večernje grickanje, odgovor treba da bude praktičan i usmeren na apetit, a ne da odmah predlaže Therm kao prvi proizvod.',
