    'Forever Aloe Propolis Crème' => 'Forever Aloe Propolis Crème',
    'R3 Factor is a cream in the regional Forever range. Explore its active ingredients and recommended routine before combining it with other facial products.' => 'R3 Factor je krema iz regionalne ponude Forever. Pre kombinovanja s drugim proizvodima za lice proveri njene aktivne sastojke i preporučenu rutinu.',
