    'Hello, <strong>{{NAME}}</strong>,<br /><br />This is a simple email to let you know that your account has been deleted because of being inactive for more than {{INACTIVITY_DAYS}} days.<br /><br />If you wish to re-gain access, you would need to sign-up another account with us.<br /><br /><a href="{{REGISTER_LINK}}" class="cta">Register again</a><br /><br />Regards,<br />The {{WEBSITE_TITLE}} team.' => 'Zdravo, <strong>{{NAME}}</strong>,<br /><br />Ovo je kratka poruka kojom te obaveštavamo da je tvoj nalog obrisan jer je bio neaktivan duže od {{INACTIVITY_DAYS}} dana.<br /><br />Ako želiš ponovo da dobiješ pristup, moraćeš da registruješ novi nalog kod nas.<br /><br /><a href="{{REGISTER_LINK}}" class="cta">Registruj se ponovo</a><br /><br />Srdačan pozdrav,<br />Tim {{WEBSITE_TITLE}}.',
    'If you want a one-month frame, this is most often positioned as 3 x Forever Aloe Vera Gel™, 1 x Forever Fields of Greens and 1 x Aloe Blossom Herbal Tea.' => 'Ako želiš okvir za jedan mesec, najčešće se predlaže 3 x Forever Aloe Vera Gel™, 1 x Forever Fields of Greens i 1 x Aloe Blossom Herbal Tea.',
    'Ovaj dio plana promijenjen je u drugom prozoru. Osvježi pregled prije spremanja.' => 'Ovaj deo plana je izmenjen u drugom prozoru. Osveži prikaz pre nego što sačuvaš izmene.',
