    'Review the copy, form, and friction inside the funnel steps because traffic enters but too few people leave a lead.' => 'Pregledaj tekst, obrazac i prepreke unutar koraka prodajnog toka jer posetioci dolaze, ali premalo njih ostavlja kontakt podatke.',
