    'Forever Card Club uses smart referral links designed for global sharing. When a visitor clicks your link or selects a product inside your app and chooses "order", the system can automatically detect the visitor’s country and connect them to the official Forever web shop in their country. Your referral is built into the link so the purchase can be associated with you as the recommending partner, in line with the official system rules. Important: Forever Card Club does not sell products. All purchases are completed through the official web shop in the customer’s country.' => 'Forever Card Club koristi pametne preporučne linkove namenjene deljenju širom sveta. Kada posetilac klikne na tvoj link ili izabere proizvod u aplikaciji i odabere „poruči“, sistem može automatski da prepozna zemlju posetioca i poveže ga sa zvaničnom Forever internet prodavnicom u njegovoj zemlji. Tvoja preporuka je ugrađena u link, tako da se kupovina može povezati s tobom kao saradnikom koji je preporučio proizvod, u skladu sa zvaničnim pravilima sistema. Važno: Forever Card Club ne prodaje proizvode. Sve kupovine obavljaju se preko zvanične internet prodavnice u zemlji kupca.',
