    'A bio cellulose mask for a dedicated facial care moment. The ready made sheet applies to the face without mixing powders or preparing a paste.' => 'Maska od bioceluloze za poseban trenutak nege lica. Gotov list nanosi se na lice bez mešanja praha ili pripreme paste.',
    'Wrong order direction:' => 'Pogrešan smer redosleda:',
