    'For a heavy, painful or more sensitive cycle, the first step is to align everything with a doctor or gynecologist, but if you want a Forever support direction for the women routine, the base should start with one aloe drink through the month, with supplements layered on top of that foundation.' => 'Kod obilnog, bolnog ili osetljivijeg menstrualnog ciklusa, prvi korak je da sve uskladiš sa lekarom ili ginekologom. Ako želiš predlog Forever podrške za rutinu namenjenu ženama, osnova bi bio jedan napitak od aloje tokom meseca, uz dodatke ishrani koji se nadovezuju na tu osnovu.',
